        "title": "Social Studies of Science: SSK, Laboratory Studies, Actor-Network Theory",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "David Bloor, *Knowledge and Social Imagery* (1976), articulated the Strong Programme in four principles:"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-SOCIAL-STUDIES.md#008",
      "path": [
        "08-SOCIAL-STUDIES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:philosophy-of-science:08-social-studies, git-history:philosophy-of-science:08-social-studies]",
        "canonical_path": "philosophy-of-science/08-SOCIAL-STUDIES.md",
        "concepts": "[social, studies]",
        "current_path": "philosophy-of-science/08-SOCIAL-STUDIES.md",
        "id": "maxim:philosophy-of-science:social-studies",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "philosophy-of-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[social, studies]",
        "section": "philosophy-of-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Social Studies of Science: SSK, Laboratory Studies, Actor-Network Theory",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "| Principle | Statement |\n|-----------|-----------|\n| **Causality** | SSK should explain the beliefs which scientists hold — including true and correct beliefs — in terms of social causes |\n| **Impartiality** | The programme should be impartial between true and false, rational and irrational, successful and unsuccessful theories |\n| **Symmetry** | The same types of cause should explain both true and false beliefs |\n| **Reflexivity** | SSK's own program should be explicable by the same methods — the sociologist applies the analysis to himself |"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-SOCIAL-STUDIES.md#009",
      "path": [
        "08-SOCIAL-STUDIES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:philosophy-of-science:08-social-studies, git-history:philosophy-of-science:08-social-studies]",
